{
  "category": "Ore Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "When it overflows with power, the orange crystal on its body glows. It looks for underground water in caves.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because its energy was too great to be contained, the energy leaked and formed orange crystals.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it is healthy, its core sticks out. Always facing the same way, it swiftly moves front to back and left to right.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it is healthy, its core sticks out. Always facing the same way, it swiftly moves front to back and left to right.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because its energy was too great to be contained, the energy leaked and formed orange crystals.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it is healthy, its core sticks out. Always facing the same way, it swiftly moves front to back and left to right.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because its energy was too great to be contained, the energy leaked and formed orange crystals.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it is healthy, its core sticks out. Always facing the same way, it swiftly moves front to back and left to right.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its orange crystal is a mass of energy. Just one crystal fragment would provide enough fuel for a hundred dump trucks.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It explores caves in search of underground water. It’s not comfortable around water, so this Pokémon takes great care in lapping it up.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "The energy overflowing from its body has turned into orange crystals that are hard enough to smash diamonds.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its orange crystals are lumps of powerful energy. They’re valuable, so Boldore is sometimes targeted for them.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you see its orange crystals start to glow, be wary. It’s about to fire off bursts of energy.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It relies on sound in order to monitor what’s in its vicinity. When angered, it will attack without ever changing the direction it’s facing.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
